WEBVTT

00:26:59.537 --> 00:27:01.437
still associated with the skeptic camp,

00:27:01.461 --> 00:27:04.234
but he's realized
that's a pretty lonely camp,

00:27:04.258 --> 00:27:07.516
and so, he's making the R&amp;D point.

00:27:07.540 --> 00:27:11.976
And so there is a thread of something
that I think is appropriate.

00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:14.976
The R&amp;D piece --
it's crazy how little it's funded.

00:27:15.556 --> 00:27:18.843
CA: Well, Bill, I suspect I speak
on behalf of most people here

00:27:18.867 --> 00:27:20.935
to say I really hope your wish comes true.

00:27:20.959 --> 00:27:22.131
Thank you so much.

00:27:22.155 --> 00:27:23.306
BG: Thank you.

00:27:23.330 --> 00:27:28.722
(Applause)